  dialogue: {fileID: 0}
  callbacks: []
  introLines:
  - "Altta f\u0131r\u0131n\u0131m\u0131z var, depremde vitrin camlar\u0131 k\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131."
  - "Hafif hasar dediler. F\u0131r\u0131n\u0131 a\xE7al\u0131m, mahalle ekmeksiz
    kald\u0131."
  questions:
  - question: "F\u0131r\u0131n\u0131n tavan\u0131 neden bu kadar y\xFCksek?"
    answer: "F\u0131r\u0131n i\xE7in y\xFCksek tuttuk, s\u0131cak birikmesin diye."
  - question: "\xDCstte kimler oturuyor?"
    answer: "Ben, o\u011Flum, gelinim, iki de torun."
  approvedLine: "F\u0131r\u0131n yar\u0131n sabah a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r, sa\u011F olun!"
  shearWallLine: "Perde mi? Tamam, f\u0131r\u0131na bir duvar ekleriz."
  rejectedLine: "F\u0131r\u0131n\u0131 kapat\u0131rsak mahalle ne yiyecek?"
  rejectPressure: []
  collapseHeadline: "F\u0131r\u0131n \xDCst\xFC Konut'un zemin kat\u0131 \xE7\xF6kt\xFC"
  standingLine: "F\u0131r\u0131n \xDCst\xFC Konut ayakta: f\u0131r\u0131n ertesi
    sabah ekmek da\u011F\u0131tt\u0131."
